ull, "text": "I paid Fjord Analytics's approved invoice once, by wire.\n\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, wire from the operating account, status \"sent\"\n- **Invoice:** INV-64869 (due 2026-11-04), now marked paid\n- **Amount:** $5,094.41, the full invoice amount\n\nBefore sending, I checked that no payments had already gone out from the operating account. I also attached a unique key to the request, so even if it were resent it would only go through once. The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\nFjord Analytics's other two invoices weren't touched. INV-17037 ($8,225.97) was already paid. INV-64649 ($1,910.47) is a draft still awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}